WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.125
Tags are boxes: the inner one closes first

2
00:00:03.953 --> 00:00:07.928
Boxes view: every tag draws a box around its content.

3
00:00:08.454 --> 00:00:11.004
&lt;p&gt; opens a box for a paragraph...

4
00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:14.555
...and &lt;strong&gt; opens a smaller box inside it.

5
00:00:15.455 --> 00:00:18.405
&lt;/strong&gt; closes the inner box first...

6
00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:21.955
...then &lt;/p&gt; closes the outer box.

7
00:00:22.746 --> 00:00:26.071
Inner box first, then the outer one: that is nesting.
